00:25:49.050 --> 00:25:54.709
Mark Blackman: This sounds complex, and it's a, you know, a multi-stage process.

175
00:25:54.830 --> 00:26:00.009
Mark Blackman: But a lot of the upfront work is done by the nodes.

176
00:26:00.150 --> 00:26:08.519
Mark Blackman: So that verification is very low cost, and even smart contracts can verify blocks.

177
00:26:09.400 --> 00:26:10.999
Mark Blackman: At a very low cost.

178
00:26:11.290 --> 00:26:13.769
Mark Blackman: Low gas cost.

179
00:26:14.280 --> 00:26:21.630
