00:26:29.780 --> 00:26:37.300
Mark Blackman: And these… these blocks are self-contained, independently verifiable, as I mentioned.

182
00:26:37.670 --> 00:26:47.900
Mark Blackman: If you think about the use case, maybe post-Clarity in the US, or as the regulatory rules of the road start to evolve.

