185
00:27:02.930 --> 00:27:06.339
Mark Blackman: you know, post-escrow, I purchased the home.

186
00:27:06.600 --> 00:27:08.560
Mark Blackman: So having this,

187
00:27:08.960 --> 00:27:18.029
Mark Blackman: Self-contained, independent block of data is just a huge plus one for users of the network.

188
00:27:18.980 --> 00:27:23.750
Mark Blackman: Additionally, I mentioned, consolidation of data into a single stream.

189
00:27:23.860 --> 00:27:35.209
